einでローカルのディレクトリaddできるからそれで管理してます","ts":"1618123180.234500","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1618123193.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sMcAi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f18df1a8-e8e5-4a39-88d6-6911d4f523e6","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"あと私は普通にプラグイン入れてるディレクトリで開発しちゃいますね。最初だけは別ディレクトリで作ってrtp通して、公開したらプラグインマネージャー配下のディレクトリでもう直接やっちゃってます。","ts":"1618122967.232700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SsH3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31ebb98c-fefc-45ef-93e3-b60df22abdf0","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"まあ普通にCI入れてるとやっぱりブランチ切ってプルリクしたほうがやりやすいですね。","ts":"1618122837.231100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L5Mmq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1994b9fc-200d-4abc-8ce6-467bd3ae6f44","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"どのみちreleaseがあってなきがごとしなので、master HEADがぶっこわれなければ、大概文句言われれることなくすむので、個人の裁量かなと。","ts":"1618122804.230600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oU+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1d8e479f-70a4-4544-96cf-9f91011b1776","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"大体のプラグインマネージャはmasterのHEADさえ合っていれば落としてくれるので","ts":"1618122775.229800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mqn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"39de2658-b374-45ce-b692-a89f49d0c89b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"人によっててんでバラバラだと思います","ts":"1618122750.228600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WHra9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cda689bf-5293-4e48-bc3a-9c21a999a314","type":"message","user":"U01RT4HJ6BU","text":"プラグインの開発についての質問なんですけど、個人で製作したプラグインを更新する時って皆さんどのようにやっていますか？\nブランチを切って、プルリクを発行したりしているのか、特に気にせずmasterを更新し続けるのか気になってます。プラグイン開発の文化的なものがあれば知りたいです！","ts":"1618122713.228100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vg9a"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6A91E1B8-D9E8-4571-BECC-470589B86523","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"入力までってなるとお行儀悪いプラグイン入れない、もしくはお行儀よくパッチ投げる…だろうな","ts":"1618111158.224600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yxu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"BB8B5CE5-953D-4569-A3F2-B257D44DFF16","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"\u003chttps://speakerdeck.com/yosuke_furukawa/metapahuomansutiyuningu|https://speakerdeck.com/yosuke_furukawa/metapahuomansutiyuningu\u003e\nできれば入力可能まで100msにした方がいいんだろうなぁ","ts":"1618105192.222400","attachments":[{"fallback":"Speaker Deck: メタ・パフォーマンスチューニング","id":1,"title":"メタ・パフォーマンスチューニング","title_link":"https://speakerdeck.com/yosuke_furukawa/metapahuomansutiyuningu","text":"2020/12/15 @ FE Study #2 パフォーマンスチューニングの話です。","image_url":"https://files.speakerdeck.com/presentations/745527bd9a294edc8a0b034bd08f5ded/slide_0.jpg?16924445","blocks":null,"service_name":"Speaker Deck","service_icon":"https://d1eu30co0ohy4w.cloudfront.net/assets/favicon-c0fe5475f88a65b817c8cc7c0fedc01b7acc17fe27628fa13ca3f96e56e16977.png","from_url":"https://speakerdeck.com/yosuke_furukawa/metapahuomansutiyuningu","original_url":"https://speakerdeck.com/yosuke_furukawa/metapahuomansutiyuningu"}],"edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1618105228.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oeSWS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"847E8908-9A6E-46B4-A57E-0C3664C73D21","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あ、あとは今だとdenopsとcocが裏で非同期にプロセス立ち上げてinitializeするから計測した起動時間で立ち上がってないんですよね・・・","ts":"1618104864.221800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c99y="}]},{"client_msg_id":"CE4037F1-D49B-433E-A729-218738B0295B","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"最悪なのが起動よりもシェルで実行の度に引っかかるやつだけど","ts":"1618104601.219800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gvz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"50D79D3F-8668-4249-B233-7E684837805B","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"自分はシェルはカジュアルに起動するけどvimはそこまでではなかった","ts":"1618104582.219200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U01U6KDKM2M"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UUK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2e028a66-c426-4949-83ab-3c9c07943bd6","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"遅延ロード全然やってないな、基本行儀のいいプラグインしか入れないし","ts":"1618104529.218300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XEU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6BDDB668-5B84-4C9C-9AB7-288DB51D4D9F","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"zshだけはめっちゃやってる・・・","ts":"1618104492.217300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u0kC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2C099B8E-C6A6-4EEE-AB03-D0076CDFA0C8","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"大分遅いけど、自分はvimの起動時間はそこまでストレスじゃないからまぁってなりました","ts":"1618104452.216700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c7qy9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B62FACF0-2BDC-4A6F-9A24-3AC1D985FB10","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"なんかNeovimとVimで生成されるファイルが違って起動できなくなる問題が多発したから全部消したんだよなー","ts":"1618104417.215400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aqhWp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"745882dd-8ef6-4f28-a00b-cfc081a19cbc","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"今まで気にしてなかっただけで、めちゃくちゃ遅かったみたいだ","ts":"1618104393.214600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jB9K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"14d88e63-6267-4780-9fa7-d0a105b5ccd7","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"体感変わった","ts":"1618104365.213500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s9O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58da64f6-b2d4-4bea-b508-056a0892b58b","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"ありがとうございます！pluginディレクトリがあるものはすべて遅延は、結構わかりやすいのでそれをベースにしていこうと思います。\n今遅延関係設定してたら、起動時間が330msec → 97msecになった","ts":"1618104361.213300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iL3SO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"C7D96950-E420-4594-A3C1-89DA15ADCB0E","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"あくまで自分の認識ですが\n• その認識です\n• 基本遅延させずにしておいて、なんか起動遅いなってなったら startuptime みて遅いのを特定\n• それが ft 特有のなら遅延に回してます\n自分の例だと tsuquyomi と言うのが遅いんですが(2~3秒かかる)、ft 関係ないものでも引きずられると困るので遅延させてます。","ts":"1618097409.211500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WlE2v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7e409f82-2d4c-4ecd-bd3e-89df0b8a0f3e","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"基本的にはpluginディレクトリを持っているものを遅延させます","ts":"1618097369.210500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lxt1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4349ec67-dc86-4fe8-887d-a267bd165659","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"大体合っているんじゃないですかね\n例えば`A`というコマンドを実行するとはじめて動くようなプラグインは、それまでは読み込む必要がありませんからはじめから読み込まないとか\n他にもファイルタイプ固有のプラグインはそのファイルタイプになったに読み込むとか","ts":"1618097346.210100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3eELt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d66a8092-8f2d-4227-872f-0642c1db1b8b","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"質問です。遅延読み込みなんですが、ちょっと認識があやふやで、今は「重たいプラグイン等を必要なときに読み込むようにすることで起動時間が長くならないようにする」という認識なのですが、\n• この認識であっているのか\n• 遅延読み込みするプラグインはどんな種類のものか、どうやって決めているか\nについて聞きたいです","ts":"1618096501.203900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n6h"}]},{"client_msg_i